# Machine-local cargo build state of the vendored Rust workspace.
# Everything else under this app directory (sources, gen/ checked-in
# artifacts, Cargo.lock, configs) is part of the tree-in integration.
rust/target/
rust/target/
rust/adapter/target/
.mqjs-context-stamp*

# NuttX build state / stray objects (M-1 noise: MAINSRC compiled per-rule)
.built
.depend
Make.dep
*.o
*.gcno
*.gcda

# Framework build intermediates & engine archives (per SYNC.md: 不入库 —
# release include/ + output.json are the committed surface; lib/ is
# re-created by `mquickjs-build build`, build/ is its scratch dir, and the
# debug profile is fully local (mquickjs-sys derives it from PROFILE for
# test binaries only; include/ is byte-identical to the release one).
gen/target/mquickjs-build/framework/*/release/ridl/lib/
gen/target/mquickjs-build/framework/*/release/ridl/build/
gen/target/mquickjs-build/framework/*/debug/
